# B-roll clip quality

Applies to every B-roll download, pool pull, frame gate, and ship check.

## Cars — outside only

Keep **exterior** frames only. Drop cabin, cockpit, steering wheel, dashboard, seats, interior POV, and windshield-from-inside. See `car-exterior-frames.mdc`.

```
# ❌ BAD
dashboard, wheel in lap, leather seats, cabin night-drive POV

# ✅ GOOD
full body driveway, three-quarter street, side profile rolling
```

## Frame rate — 50fps+ required

Every kept clip is **50fps or higher**. Drop 24p, 25p, 30p, and 48p. Keep 50 / 59.94 / 60.

Pipeline floor: `MIN_USABLE_FPS = 50` in `scripts/build_clips_montage.py`. Delete unusable clips. Do not ship them.

```
# ❌ BAD
24fps 4K cinematic, 30fps 1080p, 48fps slow-mo

# ✅ GOOD
50fps 1080p, 60fps 1440p, 59.94fps 4K
```

## Resolution — 4K not required

Do **not** reject 1080p or 1440p. Prefer high fps over 4K. A 60fps 1080p clip beats a 24fps 4K clip. Search queries may say `4k`; still keep a non-4K clip if it is 50fps+.

Output render stays 1080×1920. Source 4K is optional, never a gate.
